{
  "id": 8859738505415,
  "title": "Personalized Celtic Yggdrasil Tree of Life Quilt Sets, Bedroom Decor",
  "handle": "personalized-celtic-yggdrasil-tree-of-life-quilt-sets-bedroom-decor",
  "body_html": "<p>Discover the enchanting Jeminise Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set, featuring the Yggdrasil design—a powerful symbol of resilience and interconnectedness. This beautiful quilt set combines artistic charm with cozy comfort, making it a thoughtful gift for loved ones or a perfect addition to your home decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Showcases the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life, symbolizing strength, growth, and family bonds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandparents, wives, husbands, sons, daughters, and other beloved family members for various occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional and decorative for use on a bed, sofa, or couch, providing warmth for indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and maintains its fluffiness, ideally in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with optional pillowcase(s) for a complete bedding experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from a blend of Polycotton, Cotton, and Polyester for a smooth and comfortable feel.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
